{"h":3209,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.11878097534179688,"x":0.085274016727243801,"h":0.015543460548852472,"y":0.046588805959208224,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"DAN:","c":1,"x":0.085436894132184762,"y":0.097383720683804964,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"c":1,"t":"BREDA:","w":0.054368928273518885,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.085436895523434725,"y":0.12936046486985142},{"x":0.08543689404966047,"y":0.14680232558948159,"w":0.036893202463785815,"c":1,"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"DAN:"},{"x":0.087378641731081452,"t":"BREDA:","y":0.16133720923289241,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"w":0.052427183787027987},{"x":0.08543689382204453,"t":"DAN.","y":0.18023255823160045,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1},{"x":0.087336355659225387,"y":0.19466021379102094,"w":0.0525117556254069,"h":0.011842362828715203,"t":"BREDA:","c":1},{"t":"DAN:","x":0.085436893828072819,"y":0.21220930220419654,"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785815,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"t":"BREDA:","x":0.087378641085854927,"h":0.010174419129748924,"c":1,"y":0.2441860462172839,"w":0.052427183787028001},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"DAN:","y":0.26017441858366763,"w":0.036893202463785815,"x":0.087378641656456604,"c":1},{"h":0.011627906728013726,"x":0.08737864144629183,"t":"BREDA:","y":0.29215116279878384,"w":0.052427183787028001,"c":1},{"w":0.034951454798380521,"y":0.30813953481428769,"t":"DAN:","x":0.089320389429288702,"h":0.011627906728013726,"c":1},{"w":0.052427183787027987,"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"t":"BREDA:","x":0.089320389303896991,"y":0.34011627900033425},{"c":1,"t":"DAN:","w":0.036893202463785815,"y":0.35755813962291172,"h":0.011627906728013726,"x":0.087378641383398348},{"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"y":0.38808139515691542,"x":0.087378642918256727,"w":0.054368928273518885,"t":"BREDA:"},{"w":0.036893202463785815,"y":0.40552325584141957,"c":1,"x":0.087378641599822296,"t":"DAN:","h":0.011627906728013615},{"w":0.054496835072835301,"y":0.41990837261249103,"t":"BREDA:","x":0.087314689698189882,"h":0.013380928871416176,"c":1},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"x":0.087378641661310971,"t":"DAN:","w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.4375000000080862},{"w":0.05252848307291666,"h":0.011885201522494393,"y":0.48533646881542092,"t":"BREDA:","c":1,"x":0.089269739662638486},{"c":1,"x":0.087378641394860068,"w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"DAN:","y":0.5188953489292748},{"h":0.018059641995534004,"c":1,"t":"Yeah. I chose to take a photo of a family sitting round the dinner table having a","y":0.09252698386407987,"x":0.18246165968548894,"w":0.6214826965332032},{"h":0.018288380037587038,"y":0.11005154584454102,"x":0.182424125716692,"c":1,"t":"meal, and, um, I didn't win, but I did get some feedback.","w":0.44677668253580738},{"w":0.23300971984863281,"y":0.12790697683408192,"x":0.18252426619301823,"t":"Oh, what did the judges say?","h":0.016018256665761621,"c":1},{"t":"That it was too 'busy' as a picture.","w":0.27184466044108074,"h":0.01467162931448196,"y":0.14389534911214352,"c":1,"x":0.18252427165907126},{"w":0.5187594095865885,"c":1,"y":0.15796665471652904,"t":"Aha - so it was the composition of the picture that they criticised?","x":0.18238964902814178,"h":0.019245840530157876},{"y":0.17407351708554497,"w":0.5322573852539062,"c":1,"x":0.18241257596847646,"h":0.019144741545585098,"t":"That's right - and once they'd told me that, I could see my mistake."},{"w":0.40600425720214839,"x":0.18244981719067133,"h":0.016147088261779574,"t":"So what was the theme of the second competition?","c":1,"y":0.19166190680944961},{"t":"Well, my university was on the coast and that area gets a lot of beautiful sunsets,","w":0.64480911254882811,"h":0.018910327804422811,"c":1,"y":0.20654854322078209,"x":0.1824407224183173},{"y":0.22674418616118697,"w":0.18252427419026693,"c":1,"h":0.011627906728013615,"t":"so that was the theme.","x":0.18446601813140376},{"t":"Oh, sunsets, that's a great theme.","x":0.18624421590942641,"h":0.016612249594239792,"y":0.24008004558326745,"c":1,"w":0.26823811848958334},{"h":0.020206586891245548,"c":1,"t":"Yes. The instructions were to capture the clouds as well - it couldn't just be blue","w":0.63138229370117194,"y":0.25412008887510718,"x":0.18431424786916389},{"y":0.27470930261637183,"c":1,"w":0.1786407725016276,"x":0.18252427380214295,"t":"sky and a setting sun.","h":0.014534883112922281},{"y":0.28735007426208869,"c":1,"w":0.50315419514973958,"t":"Sure, cause they give you all those amazing pinks and purples.","h":0.019634085206599261,"x":0.18432703687560367},{"w":0.62747589111328117,"c":1,"t":"Yeah - and I thought I'd done that well, but the feedback was that I should have","y":0.30177059796251293,"h":0.020416205100181273,"x":0.18626493975912714},{"c":1,"w":0.27184466044108069,"t":"waited a bit longer to get the shot.","y":0.32267441830869781,"h":0.014534884301301454,"x":0.18252427163336629},{"c":1,"t":"I see. So the timing wasn't right.","x":0.1823961007253197,"w":0.2565663146972656,"y":0.33681577956301867,"h":0.01672108433328312},{"c":1,"x":0.18435309089112981,"w":0.61771102905273434,"t":"Yes - I took it too soon, basically. And then the third competition I entered was","y":0.35130199534008155,"h":0.019295184411735056},{"w":0.17475728352864583,"y":0.36915887827718152,"h":0.016015540030886344,"t":"called 'Animal Magic'.","c":1,"x":0.18446602027451198},{"c":1,"x":0.18446601857967049,"w":0.23106796264648438,"t":"Well, that's a difficult subject!","y":0.38660436111515328,"h":0.016011917851052937},{"w":0.3165048472086589,"h":0.013205462898420728,"x":0.18252427534730506,"c":1,"y":0.40249221159709347,"t":"I know! I had to take hundreds of shots."},{"t":"I'm sure - because animals move all the time.","y":0.41822644486130089,"x":0.18246500861243201,"w":0.36904899597167973,"h":0.015093490862029491,"c":1},{"h":0.016440623868662962,"c":1,"x":0.18441074621982884,"y":0.43281429955094131,"w":0.615650380452474,"t":"That's what we had to show - there had to be some movement in the scene. I"},{"w":0.61186686197916673,"h":0.018693571001569764,"x":0.1843510656706176,"c":1,"t":"got a great shot of a fox in the end, but I took it at night and, well, Lsuspected","y":0.44907759577304107},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488311292217,"x":0.18446601731458742,"y":0.46656976772769587,"t":"that it was a bit dark, which is what I was told.","w":0.3650485483805338},{"w":0.63510854085286461,"y":0.480254771957624,"c":1,"t":"Well Dan - you seem to be really keen and we'd be delighted to have you in our","h":0.018618100603050136,"x":0.18439011495067936},{"t":"club. I'm sure we can help with all those areas that you've outlined.","h":0.017228509183984553,"c":1,"y":0.49747370728162621,"x":0.18438136637272531,"w":0.53218149820963545},{"t":"Thanks, that's great.","w":0.16504854838053382,"x":0.18446601710899066,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1,"y":0.51588785073396304},{"c":1,"x":0.089320388955690458,"w":0.10485436757405599,"h":0.017563210840908505,"t":"PART 2","y":0.56686046498392983},{"t":"PRESENTER:","y":0.59868251714274234,"h":0.013390779346691861,"x":0.089280227820731806,"c":1,"w":0.089400711059570315},{"y":0.5951562637743113,"c":1,"x":0.1785647116407203,"w":0.63513575236002606,"t":"This evening we're delighted to welcome Dan Beagle, who's just written a book","h":0.018697237745623707},{"y":0.61168642942338081,"w":0.60600067138671876,"c":1,"h":0.018445635287561157,"t":"on looking for and finding food in the wild. He's going to tell us everything we","x":0.18632190663876391},{"w":0.35964775085449213,"h":0.020281706717898196,"t":"need to know about picking wild mushrooms.","c":1,"x":0.18617705492153486,"y":0.62787126826069661},{"h":0.011627906728013726,"c":1,"t":"DAN:","x":0.089320388956888097,"y":0.64970930241764691,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"w":0.6060966491699219,"c":1,"h":0.020941266686745563,"x":0.18628319314802941,"t":"Thank you very much. Well, I need to start by talking about safety. You really","y":0.64318627715409649},{"t":"need to know what you're doing because some mushrooms are extremely","y":0.66043760639552918,"h":0.018173179151113161,"x":0.18630761235447815,"c":1,"w":0.58855331420898438},{"w":0.60421737670898434,"c":1,"y":0.67566374292887676,"x":0.18623695700806139,"t":"poisonous. Having said that, once you know what to look for, it's really worth","h":0.020160551457390152},{"t":"doing for the amazing variety of mushrooms available - which you can't get in","y":0.69067036013569882,"x":0.18626300922791092,"w":0.61584248860677082,"h":0.021316951383311356,"c":1},{"x":0.18628756410769862,"w":0.64101501464843746,"t":"the shops. But of course, you have to be very careful and that's why I always say","y":0.70798598154966819,"h":0.019853378010687428,"c":1},{"x":0.18628903870164246,"t":"you should never consume mushrooms picked by friends or neighbours - always","w":0.64293441772460935,"h":0.018653643836856193,"y":0.72413353271887826,"c":1},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1,"y":0.74267912772194944,"t":"remember that some poisonous mushrooms look very similar to edible ones","x":0.18640777483073331,"w":0.60194173177083332},{"c":1,"x":0.18630728336673003,"w":0.62739034016927087,"y":0.75715503742295842,"t":"and it's easy for people to get confused. The other thing to avoid is mushrooms","h":0.018238661816558421},{"c":1,"y":0.77295377507259722,"t":"growing beside busy roads for obvious reasons. But nothing beats the taste of","x":0.18625276027379556,"w":0.62169265747070312,"h":0.019815853154547813},{"c":1,"x":0.18631849446715998,"w":0.60601501464843754,"h":0.01906371190911893,"y":0.78908495909462373,"t":"freshly picked mushrooms - don't forget that the ones in the shops are often"},{"t":"several days old and past their best.","h":0.014641744548286706,"w":0.29126213073730467,"x":0.18640776960019276,"c":1,"y":0.80809968822776113},{"t":"There are certain ideas about wild mushrooms that it's important to be aware","y":0.83271028021347637,"h":0.014673440404398774,"x":0.18640775571296472,"w":0.60970876057942702,"c":1},{"y":0.84742264615724894,"h":0.019267770880107893,"x":0.18626655785227816,"c":1,"t":"of. Don't listen to people who tell you that it's only OK to eat mushrooms that","w":0.6099792989095052},{"h":0.018099299398166679,"y":0.86456051507009923,"x":0.18629628564630424,"t":"are pale or dull - this is completely untrue. Some edible mushrooms are bright","c":1,"w":0.62352513631184903},{"y":0.88044247514147678,"t":"red, for example. Personally, I prefer mushrooms cooked but it won't do you any","w":0.63514175415039054,"h":0.018762985419632838,"c":1,"x":0.18630378791855171},{"c":1,"w":0.62931264241536466,"x":0.18824654042131897,"t":"harm to eat them uncooked in salads - it's not necessary to peel them. Another","y":0.89652327228109585,"h":0.018320309410214008},{"c":1,"t":"110","w":0.036893202463785815,"y":0.96366279095892871,"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.093203884107912902},{"x":0.85048543616416949,"t":"Q6","c":1,"y":0.25436046497886311,"w":0.02718446731567381,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.02718446731567381,"c":1,"y":0.33575581382385888,"t":"Q7","x":0.85242718372080395,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.02718446731567381,"t":"Q8","y":0.35174418591328838,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"x":0.85242718372827198},{"y":0.43168604636925678,"t":"Q9","w":0.02718446731567381,"x":0.85242718372963,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"y":0.44767441886323367,"t":"Q10","x":0.8524271850848546,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"h":0.0154901320317824,"c":1,"t":"Q11\/12","y":0.7230258119936076,"x":0.85386672734711166,"w":0.063184083302815774},{"y":0.75497007323977239,"t":"Q11\/12","x":0.85563917184948612,"h":0.015799444561063969,"w":0.061513633728027317,"c":1},{"x":0.85631067803312744,"w":0.062135925292968741,"y":0.8473837212100116,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"Q13\/14","c":1}]}